<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 28/29.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 28/29.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, April 29 on Monday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   29.04.97	  28.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4932	    6.4958</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3109	    2.3318</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5082	    4.5402</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1557	    3.1785</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5135	    0.5201</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7693	    0.7756</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2889	    0.2915</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8505	    6.8734</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6965	    0.6965</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2653	    1.2702</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
